{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01425","headline":"相和歌辞 贾客词 · 刘驾","name":"相和歌辞 贾客词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾客灯下起，犹言发已迟。\n高山有疾路，暗行终不疑。\n寇盗伏其路，猛兽来相追。\n金玉四散去，空囊委路岐。\n扬州有大宅，白骨无地归。\n少妇当此日，对镜弄花枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}